sequenceDiagram
    actor Candidate
    participant UI as RMS Web Portal
    participant Auth as Authentication Service
    participant RMS as Recruitment Service
    participant DB as Database

    Candidate->>UI: Register / Login
    UI->>Auth: Authenticate User
    Auth->>DB: Validate Credentials
    DB-->>Auth: Authentication Result
    Auth-->>UI: Login Success

    Candidate->>UI: Complete Profile
    UI->>RMS: Save Candidate Profile
    RMS->>DB: Store Profile
    DB-->>RMS: Profile Saved
    RMS-->>UI: Profile Updated

    Candidate->>UI: Upload Resume
    UI->>RMS: Upload Resume
    RMS->>DB: Save Resume
    DB-->>RMS: Resume Stored

    Candidate->>UI: Apply for Job
    UI->>RMS: Submit Application
    RMS->>DB: Save Application
    DB-->>RMS: Application Created
    RMS-->>UI: Application Submitted

    UI-->>Candidate: Confirmation